    "title": "Police pursuit of box truck ends in Beverly Hills - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tabor Brewster ,\n4 hours ago A police pursuit of a stolen box truck ended with the arrest of a 40-year-old man in Beverly Hills on Friday, Dec. 19, the Beverly Hills Police Department said. The BHPD received a report at 3:41 p.m. of a white box truck driving recklessly eastbound on Wilshire Boulevard near Santa Monica Boulevard. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
